<title>HONG KONG: Hong Kong November merchandise trade figures.</title>
<headline>Hong Kong November merchandise trade figures.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Census and Statistics Department on Monday released the following figures for Hong Kong's merchandise trade.</p>
<p>(Rounded figures in billions of Hong Kong dollars and year-on-year percentage change)</p>
<p>					  Nov 1996	   Oct 1996</p>
<p>Re-exports to the five main destinations</p>
<p> China				 36.58 (+13.0)    37.87 (+13.8)</p>
<p> U.S.				  19.31 (+11.3)    23.48 (+ 4.9)</p>
<p> Japan				  7.08 (+ 3.2)     7.88 (+12.6)</p>
<p> Germany				3.95 (- 3.8)     4.15 (- 0.5)</p>
<p> U.K.				   3.13 (+ 1.0)     3.59 (+ 8.5)</p>
<p>Domestic exports to the five main destinations</p>
<p> China				  5.48 (+ 6.6)    5.90 (+ 7.1)</p>
<p> U.S.				   4.56 (- 5.9)    5.39 (-14.1)</p>
<p> Japan				  0.96 (- 5.6)    0.96 (- 4.6)</p>
<p> Germany				1.00 (- 3.4)    0.91 (+ 2.6)</p>
<p> U.K.				   0.91 (- 2.1)    0.90 (- 4.4)</p>
</text>
